    "description": "Objective\n\nStrip the Rep view down to what Reps need without losing data or Ops visibility.\n\nImplementation Requirements\n\n* Move non-essential fields into a More Info tab visible to Ops\n\n* HIDE, DO NOT DELETE\n\n* Only delete fields that are genuinely duplicated on the same screen\n\nAcceptance Criteria\n\n* Rep view contains only working fields\n\n* Ops can still reach every field\n\n* No field deleted unless it was a same-screen duplicate\n\nAdditional Notes\n\nThe hide-don't-delete rule is the important part of this ticket — make sure it survives into the build. Related: BUILD-41 field mapping.\n\nAlso outstanding from build notes 2026-07-27: filter to display Proof Info and Referral Info for non-Reps on non-In-Progress statuses.\n\nEstimate: S · \\~5h\n\nSource: Wagertech Additional User Stories, July 2026 — item 28.",
